      "detailsHtml": "<ul>\n <li>ExoPlayer:\n  <ul>\n   <li>Fix bug where <code>ProgressiveMediaSource</code> propagates out-of-date timeline info to player and the queued periods unexpectedly get removed (<a href=\"https://github.com/androidx/media/issues/3016\">#3016</a>).</li>\n  </ul></li>\n <li>Session:\n  <ul>\n   <li>Fix issue where system UI button placement workaround negatively affects other UI surface like Android Auto or manufacturers not needing the workaround (<a href=\"https://github.com/androidx/media/issues/3041\">#3041</a>).</li>\n  </ul></li>\n <li>Cast extension:\n  <ul>\n   <li>Fix bug where transferring from Cast to local playback was broken.</li>\n  </ul></li>\n</ul>",
